{"name":"fp-fddup-stdout-to-stderr","expect":"allow","command":"ls .codex >&2","reason":"fd 番号省略形 >&2 も fd 複製"}
{"name":"fp-fddup-close","expect":"allow","command":"cat .codex/config.toml 2>&-","reason":">&- (fd クローズ) も書き込みではない"}
